      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Fragment set:html={featureIcons.box} /></span>
        <h3 class="feature-title">零依赖无框架</h3>
        <p class="feature-desc">纯 CSS class 契约 + 按需 behavior JS，SSR 安全；React / Vue / 原生都能接，类型面（.d.mts）随包发布。</p>
